## Why This Is Asked

Tests must detect and remediate policy drift that could break tenant isolation. This question probes understanding of Vault Enterprise namespace isolation, policy scoping, audit visibility, and rollback integrity.

## Key Concepts

- Policy isolation and drift detection
- Namespace-aware authentication flows
- Audit logging and leak prevention
- Safe rollback and lease revocation

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo-test harness outline
const driftPolicy = fetchPolicy('root').replace("secret/*", "secret/*, !secret/ns-a/*");
applyPolicy('root', driftPolicy);
login({namespace: 'ns-b', role: 'tester'});
tryAccess('ns-a', 'secret/data/alpha');
assert(accessDenied);
restorePolicy('root', previousPolicyVersion);
revokeLeasesForUser('ns-b');
